{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug Off demo</strong>\u00a0gives you a mission to protect <i>The Golden Egg</i> by squashing as many bugs as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bullet Time:</strong> Every bug you squash slows down time, giving you a chance to chain even more kills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to stop bugs from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Fully compatible with Steam Input for a smooth controller experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Deck Support:</strong> Optimized UI and gameplay for a great experience on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo limitations:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is not saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements are disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New items cannot be unlocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New bug types are not available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slipper upgrades are disabled</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690430?t=1746172997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690430?t=1746172997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690430/62af87f45d665b4490b6f7d532cae46c8074b00e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746172997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690430/62af87f45d665b4490b6f7d532cae46c8074b00e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746172997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descriptio